Z||000000||Wannabe||07-22-2001||12:16 AM||||Is anybody running 16x8 wheels on the back of their Fiero? What offset range works? A set of 16x7 42mm offset rims mounted on the back of my '87 only left about 1/4 of clearance to the strut. I'm looking at a set of 16x8" 42 mm offset wheels for the back of my '88 and was wondering if they will fit without problems.||||reg||1
Z||000001||AkursedX||07-22-2001||01:21 AM||||I have a pair of 17x8 rims with a 40mm offset and they fit just fine.  <P>I think 16x8 rims with that offset should work just fine, although they would stick out 2mm more, but that isn't anything that is really noticeable.<P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
